# Evidence: https://translationproject.org/domain/coreutils.html
# Evidence-SHA256: 111972aaa5309f79650bc2829a8de0d1471e575d9f6e907fddb21022603067a0
# Source-evidence: {}
# Publication: reviewed-local
#. Review-note (JSON): "Bevara BEL-beteckningen som i originalets teckentabell."
msgctxt "[\"Translation Project\",\"coreutils\",\"\",\"15038\",\"0535f0b5c8af0dea329d4751\"]"
msgid ""
"\n"
"ARRAYs are specified as strings of characters.  Most represent themselves.\n"
"Interpreted sequences are:\n"
"\n"
"  \\NNN            character with octal value NNN (1 to 3 octal digits)\n"
"  \\\\              backslash\n"
"  \\a              audible BEL\n"
"  \\b              backspace\n"
"  \\f              form feed\n"
"  \\n              new line\n"
"  \\r              return\n"
"  \\t              horizontal tab\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"VEKTORer anges som strängar av tecken.  De flesta representerar sig själva.\n"
"Följande sekvenser tolkas:\n"
"\n"
"  \\NNN            tecken med det oktala värdet NNN (1 till 3 oktala siffror)\n"
"  \\\\              omvänt snedstreck\n"
"  \\a              ljudsignalen BEL\n"
"  \\b              backsteg\n"
"  \\f              sidmatning\n"
"  \\n              nyrad\n"
"  \\r              vagnretur\n"
"  \\t              horisontell tabulator\n"

