msgctxt "[\"Translation Project\",\"coreutils\",\"\",\"2449\",\"179f68acf63219a0e4b37f32\"]"
msgid ""
"\n"
"DIGEST determines the digest algorithm and default output format:\n"
"  sysv      (equivalent to sum -s)\n"
"  bsd       (equivalent to sum -r)\n"
"  crc       (equivalent to cksum)\n"
"  crc32b    (only available through cksum)\n"
"  md5       (equivalent to md5sum)\n"
"  sha1      (equivalent to sha1sum)\n"
"  sha2      (equivalent to sha{224,256,384,512}sum)\n"
"  sha3      (only available through cksum)\n"
"  blake2b   (equivalent to b2sum)\n"
"  sm3       (only available through cksum)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"KONTROLLSUMMA styr kontrollsummealgoritmen och standardutmatningsformatet:\n"
"  sysv      (likvärdigt med sum -s)\n"
"  bsd       (likvärdigt med sum -r)\n"
"  crc       (likvärdigt med cksum)\n"
"  crc32b    (endast tillgängligt via cksum)\n"
"  md5       (likvärdigt med md5sum)\n"
"  sha1      (likvärdigt med sha1sum)\n"
"  sha2      (likvärdigt med sha{224,256,384,512}sum)\n"
"  sha3      (endast tillgängligt via cksum)\n"
"  blake2b   (likvärdigt med b2sum)\n"
"  sm3       (endast tillgängligt genom cksum)\n"
"\n"

