msgctxt "[\"Translation Project\",\"man-db-manpages\",\"\",\"820\",\"3faf330805c8979c0b2664dc\"]"
msgid "This command will decompress and format the nroff source manual page I<./foo.1x.gz> into a B<device independent (dvi)> file.  The redirection is necessary as the B<-T> flag causes output to be directed to B<stdout> with no pager.  The output could be viewed with a program such as B<xdvi> or further processed into PostScript using a program such as B<dvips>."
msgstr "Kommandot dekomprimerar och formaterar nroff-källmanualsidan I<./foo.1x.gz> till en B<enhetsoberoende (dvi)>-fil. Omdirigeringen behövs eftersom alternativet B<-T> skickar utdata till B<stdout> utan sidvisare. Utdata kan visas med exempelvis B<xdvi> eller bearbetas vidare till PostScript med exempelvis B<dvips>."

