# Review: 71f1b4f6c55bafb34369a61e
# Evidence: https://translationproject.org/domain/libgphoto2.html
# Evidence-SHA256: 111972aaa5309f79650bc2829a8de0d1471e575d9f6e907fddb21022603067a0
# Source-evidence: {}
# Publication: reviewed-local
#. Review-note (JSON): "Korrigerad svensk fackterminologi eller idiomatiskt språkbruk efter manuell granskning."
msgctxt "[\"Translation Project\",\"libgphoto2\",\"\",\"3706\",\"71f1b4f6c55bafb34369a61e\"]"
msgid ""
"This driver supports cameras with Mars MR97310 chip (and direct\n"
"equivalents ??Pixart PACx07??).\n"
"These cameras do not support deletion of photos, nor uploading\n"
"of data.\n"
"Decoding of compressed photos may or may not work well\n"
"and does not work equally well for all supported cameras.\n"
"Photo data processing for Argus QuickClix is NOT SUPPORTED.\n"
"If present on the camera, video clip frames are downloaded \n"
"as consecutive still photos.\n"
"For further details please consult libgphoto2/camlibs/README.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denna drivrutin stöder kameror med Mars MR97310-chip (och direkta\n"
"motsvarigheter, ??Pixart PACx07??).\n"
"Kamerorna stöder varken radering av bilder eller överföring\n"
"av data.\n"
"Avkodning av komprimerade bilder kan fungera olika bra\n"
"för olika kameror som stöds.\n"
"Behandling av bilddata för Argus QuickClix STÖDS INTE.\n"
"Om videoklipp finns på kameran hämtas deras bildrutor\n"
"som på varandra följande stillbilder.\n"
"Mer information finns i libgphoto2/camlibs/README.\n"

