msgctxt "[\"Translation Project\",\"tin-man\",\"\",\"1069\",\"ab330f710af7742b1fc1ecac\"]"
msgid "The serverrc menu (accessible from the options menu with B<ConfigServerrcMenu> ('B<s>')) can be used to change the server specific settings which are stored in I<${TIN_HOMEDIR:-\"$HOME\"}/.tin/$NNTPSERVER/serverrc>.  Changing the value of B<cache_overview_files>, B<compress_overview_files> or B<nntp_pipeline_limit> will be become effective immediately for all groups visited after the change.  Changing any other values, i.e. B<add_cmd_line_opts> or B<disabled_nntp_cmds>, do require a restart to take effect."
