#. Review-note (JSON): "Rättar standardutdata, e-postformuleringar och den tekniska beskrivningen av shar-funktionalitet."
msgctxt "[\"Translation Project\",\"sharutils\",\"\",\"366\",\"bb091351614ec1fa32aad87b\"]"
msgid ""
"'shar' creates \"shell archives\" (or shar files) which are in text format\n"
"and can be emailed.  These files may be unpacked later by executing them\n"
"with '/bin/sh'.  The resulting archive is sent to standard out unless the\n"
"'-o' option is given.  A wide range of features provide extensive\n"
"flexibility in manufacturing shars and in specifying 'shar' \"smartness\".\n"
"Archives may be fairly simple ('--vanilla-operation') or essentially a\n"
"mailable 'tar' archive.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"”shar” skapar ”skalarkiv” (eller shar-filer) i textformat\n"
"som kan skickas med e-post. Dessa filer kan senare packas upp genom att köras\n"
"med ”/bin/sh”. Det resulterande arkivet skrivs till standardutdata om inte\n"
"flaggan ”-o” anges. Ett stort antal funktioner ger omfattande flexibilitet när\n"
"shar-filer skapas och när ”shar”:s funktionalitet ställs in.\n"
"Arkiv kan vara ganska enkla (”--vanilla-operation”) eller i princip ett\n"
"e-postbart ”tar”-arkiv.\n"
"\n"

