msgid "The argument _columns_, for the **--table-*** options below, is a comma-separated list of user-supplied names defined with *--table-columns* _name1_**,**_name2_**,**..., or indices of columns as they appear in the input, beginning with 1, or names defined through a *--table-column* attribute.  It's possible to mix names and indices. The special placeholder '0' (e.g. -R0) may be used to specify all columns and '-1' (e.g. -R -1) to specify the last visible column.  It's possible to use ranges like '1-5' when addressing columns by indices."
