# Review: cd6f13e82eaedbdebf123c32
# Evidence: https://translationproject.org/domain/procps-ng-man.html
# Evidence-SHA256: 111972aaa5309f79650bc2829a8de0d1471e575d9f6e907fddb21022603067a0
