msgid "Just before running the program, mount the binfmt_misc filesystem at _mountpoint_ (default is _/proc/sys/fs/binfmt_misc_).  It also implies creating a new mount namespace since the binfmt_misc mount would otherwise mess up existing programs on the system.  The new binfmt_misc filesystem is explicitly mounted as private (with *MS_PRIVATE*|*MS_REC*)."
