msgid "Set the owner user and group when creating a user namespace. These determine which user in the parent namespace has CAP_SYS_ADMIN in the new child namespace and can *setns*(2) into it. This option allows a privileged user to create a namespace on behalf of an unprivileged one, using its privileges to map ids and/or bind mount the namespace into the filesystem. It implies *--user*."
