msgid "*last* searches back through the _/var/log/wtmp_ file (or the file given with the *-f* option)  and displays a list of all users who logged in (and out) since that file was created.  One or more _usernames_ and/or _ttys_ can be given, in which case *last* will show only the entries matching those arguments. (Names of _ttys_ can be abbreviated, thus *last 0* is the same as *last tty0*.)"
