"  -e, --exit              Also show exits from the function calls\n"
"  -f, --follow            Trace child processes\n"
"  -o, --output FILENAME   Write output to FILENAME (or FILENAME.$PID in case\n"
"\t\t\t  -f is also used) instead of standard error\n"
